      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\n\nThe fixed angle has exact values\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\pi\\right)=-1,\\qquad \\sin\\left(\\pi\\right)=0.\n$$\n\nSubstitute $u=\\theta$ and $v=\\pi$, then simplify the coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin\\left(\\theta-\\pi\\right)&=\\sin \\theta\\cos\\left(\\pi\\right)-\\cos \\theta\\sin\\left(\\pi\\right)\\\\\n&=\\sin \\theta\\left(-1\\right)-\\cos \\theta\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\sin \\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
